&lt;div class=&quot;content-intro&quot;&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;LTK’s mission is to empower the world’s premium lifestyle Creators to achieve maximum economic success. We have a huge opportunity ahead of us and we’re looking for team members who want to create, innovate and disrupt an industry.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;We empower our team members to drive innovation, create value, and continue to spearhead the creation of this industry — a game changer when it comes to career growth.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Position Title&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: 400;&quot;&gt;: &lt;/span&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Paid Media Specialist (Contractor)&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/strong&gt;Location: Remote&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Reports to: Sr. Director, Partnership Media&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Role is from October 12th - December 30th, 2026&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;span style=&quot;color: rgb(255, 255, 255);&quot;&gt;#LI-CW1&amp;nbsp;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;About the role&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;The Paid Media Specialist will be responsible for assisting in the&amp;nbsp; execution of boosting Creator posts on Instagram and TikTok, from start to finish, including but not limited to campaign set-up, targeting parameters, implementation of UTM tracking, reporting on campaign performance, etc, for brands in verticals such as Fashion, Beauty, Big-Box retailers, retail media networks, etc.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;The ideal candidate will have 3+ years of digital media experience, specifically paid social, including but not limited to META, and TIKTOK. This candidate will manage and coordinate budgets, planning calendars,&amp;nbsp; assets, materials and approvals.&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;Role requires marketing knowledge with creativity and passion to deliver bar-raising, best-in-class digital marketing.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;The ideal candidate will have experience implementing and managing paid social campaigns, working closely with creator content, and influencer marketing campaigns, collaboration with sales departments, and&amp;nbsp; analyzing results and performance.&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&amp;nbsp;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;How you will make an impact&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Develop, strategize, and execute creator boosting campaigns against targeted audiences from ideation to post campaign analysis&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Facilitate teams campaign operations and workflow deadlines, deliverables and processes to ensure successful and on-time campaign execution&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Support the Marketing team by monitoring KPIs (such as website traffic, top-of-funnel conversions, ads performance, and revenue) and informing on findings&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Perform analysis of key business metrics to evaluate success and growth opportunities&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Coordinate boosting efforts with Campaign Operations team&lt;/li&gt;
&lt;/ul&gt;
&lt;p&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Key Measures:&lt;/strong&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
&lt;ul&gt;
&lt;li&gt;Effectively manage Media Boosting on META and TIKTOK driving significant incremental traffic through boosted posts that beat industry standard media buy click through rates.&lt;/li&gt;
